{"unit_id":"tag:0GQ9:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004> 与 <MATH_0005> 如（<REF_0001>）所述。记 <MATH_0006> 为对应于扩张（extension）<MATH_0007> 的元素（element），该扩张以 <MATH_0008> 为被扩张对象、以 <MATH_0009> 为核，对应由引理 <REF_0002> 给出。解（solutions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）与\n<MATH_0010>\n在 <MATH_0011> 的像（image）上的纤维（fibre）具有典范双射（canonically bijective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"canonically bijective","target_term":"典范双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"结构层扩张。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"对应扩张的 Ext 元素。"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解","context":"所求提升。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"解的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"同构类集合。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"指定 Ext 元素的像。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"Ext 映射的纤维。"},{"source_term":"canonically bijective","target_term":"典范双射","context":"解与纤维之间。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GQ9:proof","translation":"将引理 <REF_0001> 应用于 <MATH_0001> 以及 <MATH_0002>-模（module）<MATH_0003>，可知元素（elements）<MATH_0004>（属于 <MATH_0005>）参数化扩张（extensions）<MATH_0006>，这是 <MATH_0007>-代数（algebras）的扩张。将引理 <REF_0002> 应用于 <MATH_0008> 与 <MATH_0009>，可知存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>，它在 <MATH_0011> 上且与 <MATH_0012> 及 <MATH_0013> 相容，当且仅当 <MATH_0014> 映到（maps）<MATH_0015>。当然，这等价于说 <MATH_0016> 是（<REF_0003>）的一个解（solution）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映到"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定系数模。"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 元素。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"代数扩张。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"相对代数。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所求提升。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映到","context":"Ext 映射的作用。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"原提升问题的解。"}],"notes":["remark：原文 an morphism 的冠词问题留存，保护数学字节未更正。"]}
