{"unit_id":"tag:0D16:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的加厚（thickening），按《关于空间态射（Morphisms）的更多内容》第 <REF_0001> 节的定义，以及\n<STRUCT_0003> 相应的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0005>（带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的态射，见《空间的性质（Properties of Spaces）》引理 <REF_0002>）是第 <REF_0003> 节意义下的加厚（thickening）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"Properties of Spaces","target_term":"空间的性质"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定及相应态射。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两种加厚定义。"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚","context":"两个定义中的加厚。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间态射","context":"引用章节名。"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"关联对象。"},{"source_term":"Properties of Spaces","target_term":"空间的性质","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D16:proof","translation":"强调指出，这并非平凡之事。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设 (1)。由《关于空间态射（Morphisms）的更多内容》引理 <REF_0001>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0001> 诱导小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（sites）的等价（equivalence），特别是拓扑斯（topoi）的等价。当然，<MATH_0002> 按加厚（thickenings）的定义是满射（surjective），其核（kernel）局部幂零（locally nilpotent）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假设 (2)。（此方向不那么重要，更多是出于好奇。）对于任意平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，可见 <MATH_0004> 有与 <MATH_0005> 相同的平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑斯（topos）。特别地，<MATH_0006> 拟紧（quasi-compact），当且仅当 <MATH_0007> 拟紧（quasi-compact），因为拟紧（quasi-compact）是一个拓扑斯（topos）理论概念（《景（Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>）。说明这些后，可知 <MATH_0008> 拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），当且仅当 <MATH_0009> 拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）（因为可如下刻画 <MATH_0010> 拟分离（quasi-separated）：对于所有拟紧（quasi-compact）代数空间（algebraic spaces）<MATH_0011>，若它们在 <MATH_0012> 上平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale），则 <MATH_0013> 拟紧（quasi-compact））。取 <MATH_0014> 为仿射（affine）。则代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0015> 拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）。对于任意拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的 <MATH_0016>-模（module）<MATH_0017>，有 <MATH_0018>，因为平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）拓扑斯（topoi）相同。于是 <MATH_0019>，因为推出（pushforward）是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的（《空间态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0003>），且 <MATH_0020> 仿射（affine）。由《空间的上同调（Cohomology of Spaces）》命题 <REF_0004>，可知 <MATH_0021> 仿射（affine）（本引理此方向肯定有避开这一引用的证明）。因此 <MATH_0022> 是仿射（affine）态射（morphism）。在仿射（affine）情形下，容易由第 <REF_0005> 节的条件推出，<MATH_0023> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的加厚（thickening）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"locally nilpotent","target_term"